+\textbf{Example: what a quote is worth.} The recorded supplier lists \$26.00, so awarding it 55 units
+earns A(26.00) = 1817 − 53.79·26.00 = \$418.46. A newcomer lists 15\% less, \$22.10, which is worth A = \$628.24
