+& October executor; a Housing command-line driver. Claude Code and the external Codex client use the same seat router.
+& 40 completed episodes per agent; inline receipt replay only. No published bundle or independent bundle-audit report in the review. Inherits Housing's seat and headline-score gaps. The driver is not digested in the plan.\\
+\addlinespace[4pt]
+Procurement CLI\newline 24 worlds, two task prompts, two agents
+& October executor; a Procurement command-line driver; runs on 9 October. Same CLI clients as Housing.
+& 24 receipts per run root. On 16 October, all 96 command-line receipts across both task prompts passed state and score audit; a source-pinned derivation from sealed actions reproduced every decision loss. Historical receipts still score contribution margin. Full run roots are retained.\\
+\addlinespace[4pt]
