+v\_ℓ & seat 0's value if sound & a\_ℓ + 10·s\_ℓ + U(−20, 20), with s\_ℓ = 100(0.6·κ\_ℓ + 0.4·ι\_ℓ) − 30 and κ, ι \textasciitilde{} U(0, 1); κ\_ℓ and ι\_ℓ are listing attributes shown on the board, which move seat 0's value but say nothing about quality \\
+c\^{}S\_ℓ & a sound listing's cost & max(0, a\_ℓ − U(20, 80)) \\
