+summarizes the command-line agents in the agreement case's first comparison (v1); every comparison in Section~\ref{sec:cases} adds the isolation that Section~\ref{sec:runtime} describes. The OpenRouter
+client checks the reported model and route against the pinned
+route, but cannot independently attest the hosted deployment or whether a
+requested seed or reasoning control was honored. Reasoning-effort labels
+are not a common scale of deliberation across models.
